{"id": "EUVD-2026-98945", "enisaUuid": "b39731f3-6a6c-3bdb-b608-72a88d241c71", "description": "FJ-OMS oms-erp through PRE contains a missing authentication vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to delete and rebuild product search indexes by calling public es-test maintenance endpoints in skyer-goods. Attackers can repeatedly request /v1/goods/sku/es-test to empty the shared goods_sku_index_01 index for all tenants and force full-table reloads, degrading search availability.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:12", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:46:12", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/oms-erp-es-test-unauth-index-wipe", "https://github.com/FJ-OMS/oms-erp/blob/14486c98280afd2e0372866f8f2345e2e2b32843/skyer-goods/src/main/java/org/skyer/goods/api/controller/v1/GoodsSkuController.java#L123-L131", "https://github.com/FJ-OMS/oms-erp/blob/14486c98280afd2e0372866f8f2345e2e2b32843/skyer-goods/src/main/java/org/skyer/goods/api/controller/v1/SpuController.java#L104-L111", "https://github.com/FJ-OMS/oms-erp/blob/14486c98280afd2e0372866f8f2345e2e2b32843/skyer-goods/src/main/java/org/skyer/goods/app/service/impl/SkuEsServiceImpl.java#L276-L301", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/oms-erp-through-pre-missing-authentication-via-skyer-goods-es-test-endpoints"], "aliases": ["GHSA-v986-678g-75hp", "CVE-2026-110114"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.41, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "37f80216-7df4-3377-8726-6aff8d4668da", "product": {"name": "oms-erp", "vendor": {"name": "FJ-OMS"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226434d8852bc51aadac8927bd6af706d70c8a407280"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8f08d6dc-2f5f-39d4-970d-79f05df92b21", "vendor": {"name": "FJ-OMS"}}], "isExploited": false}